      "doctrine_node_id": "tort_law_hk.negligence.professional_standard",
      "type": "legal_issue",
      "label": "Professional Standard: Bolam / Bolitho",
      "summary": "A professional is not negligent if they act in accordance with a practice accepted as proper by a responsible body of peers (Bolam), provided the practice survives logical scrutiny (Bolitho). HK adoption requires verification.",
