      "doctrine_node_id": "tort_law_hk.negligence.res_ipsa_loquitur",
      "type": "legal_issue",
      "label": "Res Ipsa Loquitur",
      "summary": "The thing speaks for itself: where the accident is of a kind that does not ordinarily happen without negligence and the defendant controlled the instrumentality, breach may be inferred.",
