      "doctrine_node_id": "tort_law_hk.negligence.causation.material_contribution",
      "type": "legal_issue",
      "label": "Causation: Material Contribution",
      "summary": "Where but-for causation cannot be proved because of evidential uncertainty, a defendant may be liable if their breach materially contributed to the harm (Fairchild / McGhee approach).",
